stateDiagram-v2
    state "First turn" as FirstTurn
    state "Tribute channel" as Tribute
    state "Recall channel" as Recall
    state "At spawn" as Spawn

    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> FirstTurn: roster by team size (3, 4 or 5)
    FirstTurn --> Field: turn 2

    state Field {
        state pick <<choice>>
        [*] --> pick
        pick --> Fight: enemy in view, or a hurt runner to follow
        pick --> BankTrip: gems to bank
        pick --> Reinforce: teammate under attack asks for help
        pick --> Farm: otherwise

        state Fight {
            state "Farm on out of reach" as FarmOn
            state odds <<choice>>
            [*] --> odds
            odds --> Engage: favourable, or a kill to finish
            odds --> Stand: stronger and can reach us, duel won
            odds --> Run: stronger and can reach us, duel lost
            odds --> FarmOn: stronger, not in reach yet
        }

        state Farm {
            state "Clear camps" as Clear
            state "Hold capture" as Hold
            state "Wait for respawn" as Wait
            [*] --> Travel
            Travel --> Clear: in reach
            Clear --> Hold: cleared
            Hold --> Wait: paid
            Wait --> Clear: respawns
            Wait --> Travel: another group
        }
    }

    Field --> Tribute: bank trip reaches a safe altar, or capture combo
    Tribute --> Field: banked
    Tribute --> Retreat: rest of the channel would kill us

    Field --> Retreat: health below 35%, or camp hits on the way out would kill
    Field --> Recall: capture recall, no enemy within 8 and (health below 80%, trip under 25 rounds, or 150+ gold)
    Retreat --> Recall: no chaser can reach within 3 turns
    Recall --> Retreat: a hit cancels it
    Retreat --> Spawn: walks in
    Recall --> Spawn: lands after 5 turns, 3 with Home emblem
    Spawn --> Field: full health (with gems, bank on the way out)

    Field --> Dead: killed
    Retreat --> Dead: killed
    Recall --> Dead: killed
    Tribute --> Dead: killed
    Dead --> Spawn: respawn after 60 ticks

    note right of Field
        Re-chosen every turn: Fight, then Bank, then Reinforce, then Farm.
        Every turn ends in a fake recall that the next turn cancels.
    end note
    note left of Spawn
        Heals to full, buys all it can afford,
        strikes enemies that reach it.
    end note
    note right of Retreat
        Recalls when safe, walks if home is near,
        fights back when caught and the duel is won.
    end note
